On Fri, Jan 2, 2015 at 11:03 AM, guskant <gusni.kantu@gmail.com> wrote:

> The poll was closed on December 27, 2014. The winner is
>
> 2. disallow CgV in cmevla/fu'ivla/ma'ovla.
>
> I will create a BPFK page about this agreement. Please modify la
> camxes so that it as well as la jbovlaste conforms to it.
>

I assume that means disallowing the sequence CgV whether it's part of one
syllable or two. I've updated the morphology page accordingly:
http://www.lojban.org/tiki/BPFK+Section%3A+PEG+Morphology+Algorithm

l <- comma* [lL] !h !glide !l

m <- comma* [mM] !h !glide !m !z

n <- comma* [nN] !h !glide !n !affricate

r <- comma* [rR] !h !glide !r

b <- comma* [bB] !h !glide !b !unvoiced

d <- comma* [dD] !h !glide !d !unvoiced

g <- comma* [gG] !h !glide !g !unvoiced

v <- comma* [vV] !h !glide !v !unvoiced

j <- comma* [jJ] !h !glide !j !z !unvoiced

z <- comma* [zZ] !h !glide !z !j !unvoiced

s <- comma* [sS] !h !glide !s !c !voiced

c <- comma* [cC] !h !glide !c !s !x !voiced

x <- comma* [xX] !h !glide !x !c !k !voiced

k <- comma* [kK] !h !glide !k !x !voiced

f <- comma* [fF] !h !glide !f !voiced

p <- comma* [pP] !h !glide !p !voiced

t <- comma* [tT] !h !glide !t !voiced


 and

onset <-  h / glide / initial



mu'o mi'e xorxes

